# Finish the phase

The plan is `learning_plan/`. Work the current phase only.

- Read that phase file before implementing.
- Do not pull a later phase forward. Langfuse belongs in phase 05, RAG in 06, Kubernetes in 12.
- Leave "Break it on purpose" in place. Do not skip a drill to save time.
- "Definition of done" is the exit check. Do not tick a phase done in `learning_plan/README.md` unless those checks pass.
- API names in the plan are pointers. At the start of a phase, check current official docs before writing code against them.

Depth on fewer phases beats a shallow pass over all of them.
